OL,3,GNEWSADriver arrested after teenager
OL,4,Adies in car crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 16-year old boy has died from
OL,7,Finjuries he sustained in a car crash in
OL,8,Fwhich two other teenage passengers were
OL,9,Finjured.
OL,11,FA blue Volkswagen Polo hit a tree
OL,12,Fbetween the carriageway of the A4104,
OL,13,Fnear Defford and Bourne Road in
OL,14,FWorcestershire, at about 21:20 BST on
OL,15,FSaturday.
OL,17,FThe driver, an 18-year-old man, was
OL,18,Farrested on suspicion of causing death
OL,19,Fby dangerous driving and driving in
OL,20,Fexcess of drink and drugs.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
