OL,3,GNEWSADriver arrested after teenager
OL,4,Adies in car crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Sgt Rose Hughes, of West Mercia
OL,7,FPolice, said the family of the boy were
OL,8,Fbeing supported by specialist officers,
OL,9,Fand appealed for anyone with
OL,10,Finformation to get in touch.
